OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm sleeping out in memory of my
OL,4,Ahusband'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA widow is set to join hundreds of
OL,7,Fpeople braving the cold weather to
OL,8,Fsleep rough for charity.
OL,10,FThe annual Molineux Sleepout will take
OL,11,Fplace on Friday, with fundraisers
OL,12,Fspending the night in the Stan Cullis
OL,13,FStand at Molineux Stadium in solidarity
OL,14,Fwith people experiencing homelessness
OL,15,Facross Wolverhampton.
OL,17,FFor Barbara Nichols-Singh, the
OL,18,Fchallenge will be a chance to honour
OL,19,Fher late husband's memory while raising
OL,20,Fmoney for the Wolves Foundation, which
OL,21,Fsupported her through her grief.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
