OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm sleeping out in memory of my
OL,4,Ahusband'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I decided to do the [sleepout] in
OL,7,Fmemory of Dougie and also because it is
OL,8,Fsuch a good cause ` I am looking
OL,9,Fforward to it," she said.
